<title>SOUTH AFRICA: De Beers CSO 1996 diamond sales hit record.</title>
<headline>De Beers CSO 1996 diamond sales hit record.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>De Beers said on Wednesday that rough diamond sales by its Central Selling Organisation (CSO) reached a record $4.834 billion in 1996 from $4.531 billion in 1995.</p>
</text>
